1
00:00:00,526 --> 00:00:04,605
You can also copy texts, links, or anything while you're dictating.

2
00:00:05,166 --> 00:00:06,605
So press the Function key again,

3
00:00:06,846 --> 00:00:08,766
or dictate whatever you want to dictate,

4
00:00:08,846 --> 00:00:11,406
and maybe copy the below text that is shown.

5
00:00:11,486 --> 00:00:14,726
Select the text, copy it by Command+C, dictate something more,

6
00:00:14,726 --> 00:00:16,686
and then place your cursor

7
00:00:17,085 --> 00:00:20,365
in the Apple Notes and tap the Function key again to submit.

8
00:00:20,365 --> 00:00:23,686
What you will see is that it pastes the links,

9
00:00:23,686 --> 00:00:26,745
the copied links or copied text along with the dictation.

10
00:00:27,146 --> 00:00:31,146
And it's a really good way to gather input while you're dictating

11
00:00:31,545 --> 00:00:33,265
so that you can paste the whole thing.

12
00:00:33,265 --> 00:00:37,466
You can submit the whole thing in a chat box, or in Claude Code,

13
00:00:37,466 --> 00:00:38,665
or in Codex, whatever.
